\newlabel{fig:training_dynamics}{{1}{4}{\textbf {Training dynamics of DINOv2 during contrastive fine-tuning on SPair-71k.} From left to right: training loss, validation PCK@0.1, and validation loss. The validation PCK steadily increases while both training and validation losses consistently decrease, indicating stable optimization and absence of overfitting}{figure.caption.6}{}}
